# Managed by auchlinux — synced to ~/.config/kdeglobals by scripts/apply-config.sh
#
# Catppuccin Mocha palette (base #1e1e2e) with #a6bbda as the accent, matching
# waybar/rofi/hyprlock. All text/background pairs verified at WCAG AA or better.
#
# Why the [Colors:*] set must stay COMPLETE: Qt Quick / Kirigami apps
# (EasyEffects 8, newer KDE QML UIs) read their palette from here via
# KColorScheme. Kvantum and qt6ct do NOT apply to them — those only style
# QtWidgets. If these groups are partial or missing, Kirigami silently falls
# back to Breeze *Light* and the app renders white.

